      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27999_chakkasuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{花火|はなび}に{着火|ちゃっか}すると、{勢|いきお}いよく{火花|ひばな}が{飛|と}び{散|ち}った。",
      "english": "When the firework was lit, sparks flew out vigorously.",
